000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.  TBADTRNS.
000400 AUTHOR.  C.I.HILLES.
000500*REMARKS.
000600*   THIS IS CALLED FROM TCDLYAB2 WHENEVER A TRANSACTION WITH
000700*   INVALID NUMERIC DATA IS ENCOUNTERED.  THIS PROGRAM WRITES
000800*   THE BAD RECORD TO A FILE.
002300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002400 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002500 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
002600 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
003100
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT BAD-TRANS-FILE ASSIGN TO DISK-DBADTRNS.
002700
003800 DATA DIVISION.
003900 FILE SECTION.
004000
004800 FD  BAD-TRANS-FILE
004900     LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
005000     RECORD CONTAINS 80  CHARACTERS
005100     DATA RECORD IS BAD-TRANS-REC.
005200 01  BAD-TRANS-REC                 PIC X(80).
005900
006000 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY CCRTFILE IN COPYCSIS.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  BUF-DDAILYTC                  PIC X(80).

053600 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BUF-DDAILYTC.
053700
053900 6000-MAIN.
055200*------- CHECK FOR EXISTANCE OF THE CIRCULAR ERROR FILE 'DBADTRNS'.
055300*------- IF NOT THERE, BUILD IT.
      *------ CALL CCRTFILE TO CREATE A TEMPORARY FILE 'XXXXXXXXXX'
           MOVE "*CURLIB"     TO CCRTFILE-LIBRARY.
           MOVE "DBADTRNS"    TO CCRTFILE-FILE.
           MOVE "0080"        TO CCRTFILE-RECORD-LENGTH.
           MOVE "01000"       TO CCRTFILE-NO-RECORDS.
           MOVE "01000"       TO CCRTFILE-INCREMENT-AMT.
           MOVE "30"          TO CCRTFILE-NO-INCREMENTS.
           CALL "CCRTFILE" USING CCRTFILE-LIBRARY,
                                 CCRTFILE-FILE,
                                 CCRTFILE-RECORD-LENGTH,
                                 CCRTFILE-NO-RECORDS,
                                 CCRTFILE-INCREMENT-AMT,
                                 CCRTFILE-NO-INCREMENTS,
                                 CCRTFILE-STATUS.

           OPEN EXTEND BAD-TRANS-FILE.
           MOVE BUF-DDAILYTC TO BAD-TRANS-REC.
           WRITE BAD-TRANS-REC.
           CLOSE BAD-TRANS-FILE.
       6990-MAIN-X.
           GOBACK.
